From 47924d68d4822ff67576391dd31198d4774e9b65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stark-X6 <1937430016@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 15:55:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Enable long multi-turn episodes: per-turn token budget,
 context clamp, error surfacing

- task_config_ppd.yaml: max_tokens_per_turn 8192, max_context_len 24576 (matches server)
- base.py: add max_context_len config field
- agent.py: clamp per-turn max_tokens to max_context_len - estimated prompt
  (1024-token margin, obs size /3 estimate); track est_prompt_tokens per step;
  trace already includes per-round transcript summary
- model.py: import json; raise with the upstream body when 'choices' is missing
  (proxy forwards vLLM 400s as 200)

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
